<title>UK: UK's Major - will say election date in due course.</title>
<headline>UK's Major - will say election date in due course.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Prime Minister John Major said on Wednesday he would announce the election date &quot;in due course&quot;.</p>
<p>Questioned by reporters, Major said: &quot;You may pick whatever date you like, I will tell you the date that I have picked in due course&quot;.</p>
</text>
